# Architecture Rule

Read `.cursor/packs/unity-game/guides/architecture.md` before implementing or reviewing any service, installer, provider, or cross-module dependency.

Key rules (NON-NEGOTIABLE):

- All game logic lives in pure C# classes — NO `using UnityEngine` in service classes.
- MonoBehaviours are thin adapters only.
- VContainer for all DI — NO singletons, NO `FindObjectOfType`.
- IEventBus for cross-module communication — NO direct concrete references across modules.
- Module structure: 5-file pattern (Interface, Service, Config, Installer, Events).
- Providers live in `Concretes/[Module]/`, never inside the module folder.
- No GameContext / service locator — each class declares only its own dependencies.
